        "contenuto_esteso": "(Adnkronos) - SHENZHEN, China, March 28, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Mandopop superstar Jay Chou's 16th studio album \"Children of the Sun\" premiered worldwide on March 25, with an exclusive release on Tencent Music Entertainment Group's platforms, including QQ Music, Kugou Music, and Kuwo Music. Since pre-orders launched on March 19, the album's sales have continued to climb, with total revenue across all platforms exceeding 100 million RMB, confirming Jay Chou's enduring appeal."
